div(class="w-full")
    div(*ngIf="showForm", class="p-4")
        div(class="mb-4 flex items-center justify-between gap-3")
            div
                h3(class="text-[15px] font-semibold text-zinc-950")
                    | {{ formMode === 'create' ? '임시 계정 생성' : '임시 계정 편집' }}
                p(class="mt-1 text-xs text-zinc-500") 테스트 사용자 속성과 SAML/OIDC 클레임을 함께 관리합니다.
            button(type="button",
                class="h-8 rounded-md border border-zinc-300 px-2.5 text-xs font-semibold text-zinc-600 transition hover:bg-zinc-50",
                (click)="onFormCancel()") 목록
        wiz-portal-idpcore-temp-account-form(
            [mode]="formMode",
            [item]="editItem",
            (onSave)="onFormSave($event)",
            (onCancel)="onFormCancel()")

    div(*ngIf="!showForm")
        div(class="flex flex-col gap-3 border-b border-zinc-200 p-4")
            div(class="flex flex-col gap-3 lg:flex-row lg:items-start lg:justify-between")
                div
                    p(class="text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-zinc-500") Test Users
                    h3(class="mt-1 text-[16px] font-semibold text-zinc-950") 임시 테스트 계정
                    p(class="mt-1 text-[13px] leading-5 text-zinc-600") 기본 24시간 유효하며, admin은 연장 또는 영구 전환할 수 있습니다.
                div(class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2")
                    button(*ngIf="items.length > 0",
                        type="button",
                        class="inline-flex h-8 items-center rounded-md border border-zinc-300 bg-white px-2.5 text-xs font-semibold text-zinc-600 transition hover:bg-zinc-50",
                        (click)="cleanupExpired()") 만료 정리
                    button(type="button",
                        class="inline-flex h-8 items-center rounded-md border border-zinc-300 bg-white px-2.5 text-xs font-semibold text-zinc-700 transition hover:bg-zinc-50",
                        (click)="openCreate()") 직접 생성
                    button(type="button",
                        [disabled]="creating",
                        class="inline-flex h-8 items-center rounded-md bg-zinc-950 px-3 text-xs font-semibold text-white transition hover:bg-zinc-800 disabled:opacity-50",
                        (click)="quickCreate()")
                        span(*ngIf="!creating") Quick Create
                        span(*ngIf="creating") 생성 중...

            div(class="grid gap-2 text-xs text-zinc-600 md:grid-cols-4")
                div(class="rounded-md bg-zinc-50 px-3 py-2") 생성 10회 / 5분
                div(class="rounded-md bg-zinc-50 px-3 py-2") 기본 24시간 유효
                div(class="rounded-md bg-zinc-50 px-3 py-2") 삭제 10회 / 5분
                div(class="rounded-md bg-zinc-50 px-3 py-2") admin 또는 등록 IP에서 삭제

        div(*ngIf="lastCreated", class="border-b border-emerald-200 bg-emerald-50 px-4 py-3")
            div(class="flex flex-col gap-3 lg:flex-row lg:items-center lg:justify-between")
                div
                    p(class="text-[13px] font-semibold text-emerald-800") 임시 계정이 생성되었습니다.
                    p(class="mt-1 text-xs text-emerald-700") 아래 값을 SP/RP 로그인 테스트에 사용하세요.
                button(type="button",
                    class="self-start rounded-md px-2 py-1 text-xs font-semibold text-emerald-700 transition hover:bg-emerald-100 lg:self-auto",
                    (click)="dismissCreated()") 닫기
            div(class="mt-3 grid gap-2 md:grid-cols-4")
                div(class="flex min-w-0 items-center gap-2 rounded-md border border-emerald-200 bg-white px-3 py-2")
                    div(class="min-w-0 flex-1")
                        p(class="text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-zinc-400") 아이디
                        p(class="truncate font-mono text-[13px] font-semibold text-zinc-900") {{ lastCreated.username }}
                    button(type="button",
                        class="rounded p-1 text-zinc-400 transition hover:bg-zinc-100 hover:text-zinc-700",
                        (click)="copyText(lastCreated.username)")
                        svg(class="size-4", xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg", fill="none", viewBox="0 0 24 24", stroke-width="1.5", stroke="currentColor")
                            path(stroke-linecap="round", stroke-linejoin="round", d="M15.666 3.888A2.25 2.25 0 0013.5 2.25h-3c-1.03 0-1.9.693-2.166 1.638m7.332 0c.055.194.084.4.084.612v0a.75.75 0 01-.75.75H9.75a.75.75 0 01-.75-.75v0c0-.212.03-.418.084-.612m7.332 0c.646.049 1.288.11 1.927.184 1.1.128 1.907 1.077 1.907 2.185V19.5a2.25 2.25 0 01-2.25 2.25H6.75A2.25 2.25 0 014.5 19.5V6.257c0-1.108.806-2.057 1.907-2.185a48.208 48.208 0 011.927-.184")
                div(class="flex min-w-0 items-center gap-2 rounded-md border border-emerald-200 bg-white px-3 py-2")
                    div(class="min-w-0 flex-1")
                        p(class="text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-zinc-400") 비밀번호
                        p(class="truncate font-mono text-[13px] font-semibold text-zinc-900") {{ lastCreated.password }}
                    button(type="button",
                        class="rounded p-1 text-zinc-400 transition hover:bg-zinc-100 hover:text-zinc-700",
                        (click)="copyText(lastCreated.password)")
                        svg(class="size-4", xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg", fill="none", viewBox="0 0 24 24", stroke-width="1.5", stroke="currentColor")
                            path(stroke-linecap="round", stroke-linejoin="round", d="M15.666 3.888A2.25 2.25 0 0013.5 2.25h-3c-1.03 0-1.9.693-2.166 1.638m7.332 0c.055.194.084.4.084.612v0a.75.75 0 01-.75.75H9.75a.75.75 0 01-.75-.75v0c0-.212.03-.418.084-.612m7.332 0c.646.049 1.288.11 1.927.184 1.1.128 1.907 1.077 1.907 2.185V19.5a2.25 2.25 0 01-2.25 2.25H6.75A2.25 2.25 0 014.5 19.5V6.257c0-1.108.806-2.057 1.907-2.185a48.208 48.208 0 011.927-.184")
                div(class="min-w-0 rounded-md border border-emerald-200 bg-white px-3 py-2")
                    p(class="text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-zinc-400") 이메일
                    p(class="truncate font-mono text-[13px] text-zinc-700") {{ lastCreated.email }}
                div(class="min-w-0 rounded-md border border-emerald-200 bg-white px-3 py-2")
                    p(class="text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-zinc-400") 만료 시각
                    p(class="truncate text-[13px] text-zinc-700") {{ lastCreated.expires }}

        div(*ngIf="loading", class="flex items-center justify-center px-4 py-10")
            span(class="text-[13px] text-zinc-400") 로딩 중...

        div(*ngIf="!loading && items.length === 0", class="flex flex-col items-center justify-center gap-2 px-4 py-12 text-center")
            svg(class="size-9 text-zinc-200", xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg", fill="none", viewBox="0 0 24 24", stroke-width="1", stroke="currentColor")
                path(stroke-linecap="round", stroke-linejoin="round", d="M15.75 6a3.75 3.75 0 11-7.5 0 3.75 3.75 0 017.5 0zM4.501 20.118a7.5 7.5 0 0114.998 0A17.933 17.933 0 0112 21.75c-2.676 0-5.216-.584-7.499-1.632z")
            span(class="text-[13px] text-zinc-500") 아직 임시 계정이 없습니다.
            span(class="text-xs text-zinc-400") Quick Create로 즉시 생성할 수 있습니다.

        div(*ngIf="!loading && items.length > 0")
            div(class="flex items-center justify-between border-b border-zinc-200 px-4 py-2.5")
                span(class="text-xs font-medium text-zinc-500") 전체 {{ items.length }}개
                span(class="text-[11px] text-zinc-400") 만료 항목은 흐리게 표시됩니다.
            div(class="overflow-x-auto")
                table(class="w-full min-w-[880px]")
                    thead
                        tr(class="border-b border-zinc-200 bg-zinc-50")
                            th(class="px-4 py-2 text-left text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-zinc-500") 아이디
                            th(class="px-4 py-2 text-left text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-zinc-500") 표시 이름
                            th(class="px-4 py-2 text-left text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-zinc-500") 이메일
                            th(class="px-4 py-2 text-left text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-zinc-500") 상태
                            th(class="px-4 py-2 text-left text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-zinc-500") 남은 시간
                            th(class="px-4 py-2 text-right text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-zinc-500") 작업
                    tbody
                        tr(*ngFor="let item of items",
                            class="border-b border-zinc-100 last:border-0 hover:bg-zinc-50",
                            [class.opacity-50]="isExpired(item)")
                            td(class="px-4 py-2.5 text-[13px] font-medium text-zinc-900 font-mono") {{ item.username }}
                            td(class="px-4 py-2.5 text-[13px] text-zinc-600") {{ item.display_name || '-' }}
                            td(class="px-4 py-2.5 text-[13px] text-zinc-600 font-mono") {{ item.email || '-' }}
                            td(class="px-4 py-2.5")
                                span(*ngIf="!item.expires", class="inline-flex items-center rounded-md bg-zinc-100 px-2 py-0.5 text-xs font-medium text-zinc-700") 영구
                                span(*ngIf="item.expires && !isExpired(item)", class="inline-flex items-center rounded-md bg-emerald-50 px-2 py-0.5 text-xs font-medium text-emerald-700") 활성
                                span(*ngIf="item.expires && isExpired(item)", class="inline-flex items-center rounded-md bg-red-50 px-2 py-0.5 text-xs font-medium text-red-700") 만료
                            td(class="px-4 py-2.5 text-[13px] text-zinc-500") {{ remainingTime(item) }}
                            td(class="px-4 py-2.5 text-right")
                                div(class="flex items-center justify-end gap-1")
                                    button(*ngIf="isAdmin() && item.expires",
                                        type="button",
                                        class="rounded-md px-2 py-1 text-xs font-medium text-sky-700 transition hover:bg-sky-50",
                                        (click)="extendValidity(item)") +24h
                                    button(*ngIf="isAdmin() && item.expires",
                                        type="button",
                                        class="rounded-md px-2 py-1 text-xs font-medium text-violet-700 transition hover:bg-violet-50",
                                        (click)="setUnlimited(item)") 무기한
                                    button(type="button",
                                        class="rounded-md px-2 py-1 text-xs font-medium text-zinc-600 transition hover:bg-zinc-100 hover:text-zinc-950",
                                        (click)="openEdit(item)",
                                        [disabled]="isExpired(item)") 편집
                                    button(*ngIf="item.can_delete",
                                        type="button",
                                        class="rounded-md px-2 py-1 text-xs font-medium text-red-600 transition hover:bg-red-50",
                                        (click)="deleteItem(item)") 삭제
                                    span(*ngIf="!item.can_delete",
                                        class="rounded-md px-2 py-1 text-xs text-zinc-300",
                                        title="삭제 권한 없음 (admin 로그인 또는 등록 IP에서만 삭제 가능)") 삭제 불가
